WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:05.074
Lab 1 runs in the non-person
identity folder, in PowerShell 7,

3
00:00:05.074 --> 00:00:10.513
against a fictional tenant whose egress
ranges are documentation ranges.

4
00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:14.571
Step one runs the tests on Learn's
sample and page as published:

5
00:00:14.571 --> 00:00:18.312
nine pass, and the other
thirty-nine in that file aren't run.

6
00:00:18.312 --> 00:00:22.325
Step two lists three tasks,
with three sets of permissions.

7
00:00:22.325 --> 00:00:25.800
Reading the policies needs
application and policy read.

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.850
Reading sign-ins needs the audit
log and the Conditional Access read.

9
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.225
Only the apply task holds
the Conditional Access write.

10
00:00:33.225 --> 00:00:37.393
Step three runs the pre-merge
check on the repository's own

11
00:00:37.393 --> 00:00:41.300
files and the fixture scope:
no findings, exit code zero.

12
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.400
And step four runs the same
check on Learn's sample.

13
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:49.850
It fails five times: oh one twice,
oh seven twice, and oh eight once.

14
00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:52.800
The sample is a model,
not a file to create.
